# Design tokens & theme

Theme toggle uses `html.dark` only — not `prefers-color-scheme`. Tailwind dark variant: `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));`.

## Backgrounds

- Light page: white `#ffffff` (`bg-page` / `--sa-bg-page`) — **not** cream everywhere
- Cream `#fbf7f0` (`bg-cream` / `section-soft` in light): sections only (Why, newsletter, search field, etc.)
- Footer / always-dark surfaces: `bg-inverse` (`--sa-bg-inverse`) — light `#2c241d`, dark `#241d18`
- Do **not** use hardcoded `bg-ink` for footer (stays `#2c241d` in dark and mismatches newsletter)

## Brand colors

- Terra `#B46E57` — primary CTAs
- Gold `#B5883E` / gold-light `#CDA766` — eyebrows, accents
- No purple, glow, or generic AI-gradient looks

## Logo

- Asset: `/assets/home/swiss-arabian-logo.png` via `homeAssets.logo`
- Header (theme-aware): class `site-logo` — cream filter only under `html.dark`
- Footer / inverse surfaces (always dark): class `site-logo-on-dark` — cream filter always
- Never use a terra “SA” circle placeholder when the real logo is available
